<title>AZERBAIJAN: SOCCER-AZERBAIJAN 1 FINLAND 2 WORLD CUP QUALIFIER - RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AZERBAIJAN 1 FINLAND 2 WORLD CUP QUALIFIER - RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>BAKU 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland beat Azerbaijan 2-1 in</p>
<p>their World Cup European group three qualifier on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Azerbaijan - Nazim Suleymanov 80 pen</p>
<p>Finland - Jari Litmanen 25, Mika-Matti Paatelainen 66</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
<p>Standings</p>
<p>			  P   W   D   L   F   A  Pts </p>
<p> Norway		 3   3   0   0   9   0   9</p>
<p> Hungary		3   2   0   1   4   3   6</p>
<p> Finland		3   1   0   2   4   5   3</p>
<p> Switzerland	  3   1   0   2   3   4   3</p>
<p> Azerbaijan	   4   1   0   3   2  10   3</p>
<p>Next matches: April 30 Norway v Finland, Switzerland v</p>
<p>Hungary</p>
</text>
